  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)<br>\n<strong>Enhances:</strong> Mantis Blade<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p>Enhances Mantis Blades. It covers two installations on separate arms when purchased and doesn't count toward either blade's enhancement limit. While Combat Software (Spatial Mapping) is installed, if the user has active paired Jump Boosters or Reinforced Tendons and has landed at least one Mantis Blade attack in the previous 2 Rounds, Spatial Mapping is charged. It can then be used at any point in the rest of the combat as a ROF 1 Attack Action: the user leaps up to 8m/yds straight at a target in line of sight, costing none of their MOVE and taking no movement penalty. If that gets them into melee range, their next successful hit on that target with an enhanced Mantis Blade deals 2d6 extra damage (6d6) and ablates 2 extra SP if it would ablate armor.</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Cyberarms).</em></p>"
